{"synopsis":"Almamater, kampung halaman, ikatan darah—Semuanya hanya kepalsuan belaka!”\n\nPerang melawan organisasi kriminal yang dilancarkan oleh pemerintah telah gagal dengan menyedihkan…\n\nDunia pun berubah menjadi medan kekacauan yang dikuasai oleh tinju masing-masing.\n\nOrang yang menyatukan neraka ini, Presdir dari Taejin Group, “Jin Young-ui” telah memutuskan untuk menyelenggarakan sebuah kompetisi dengan nama “Festival Pendekar” untuk mencari seorang penerus.\n\nAkankah preman pengangguran kita, “Kang Daeoh” naik ke puncak piramida ini?!","alternative_title":"Namje, Festival of Warriors,","author":"Major","artist":"Yoon Young Il","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"16220280-45a3-4e0e-9b0e-95e7987ac2aa","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2026-04-18","released":"2026-04-18","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6-97a7bc572507/chapter_ch_68/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"9cc8e943-a484-404f-9e85-5aa122c0df36","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2026-04-18","released":"2026-04-18","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e171325b-d137-4c45-9ad6